unity-project/[Ll]ogs/
unity-project/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
unity-project/[Uu]serSettings/
unity-project/Screens/
unity-project/Recordings/

# Third-party Unity Asset Store packs inside unity-project (re-derivable / manifested in docs/ASSET-PACKS-MANIFEST.md)
unity-project/Assets/LeartesStudios/
